":2269765506,"text":"#Here you are, Nara {NICKNAME}, White Floaty. Welcome you, the three of us.","nextNodeIds":[730590204]},{"nodeId":730590204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20578,"speakerName":"Aranaga","textMapHash":2681301818,"text":"Here comes the moon. Now, is the time to plant flowers. Are you ready?","nextNodeIds":[730590205]},{"nodeId":730590205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3799873530,"text":"I am ready.","nextNodeIds":[730590206]},{"nodeId":730590206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3192693010,"text":"Paimon too!","nextNodeIds":[730590207]},{"nodeId":730590207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20578,"speakerName":"Aranaga","textMapHash":323126882,"text":"So... Aranakin, Aragaru, let's start the ritual.","nextNodeIds":[730590208]},{"nodeId":730590208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20578,"speakerName":"Aranaga","textMapHash":3168236146,"text":"\"Be back home, be back home, dreams of the garden, memories of the forest...\"","nextNodeIds":[730590209]},{"nodeId":730590209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20576,"speakerName":"Aranakin","textMapHash":1276250594,"text":"\"Embrace, let us:\"","nextNodeIds":[730590210]},{"nodeId":730590210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20576,"speakerName":"Aranakin","textMapHash":1451588826,"text":"\"Deeper dreams, everlasting happiness.\"","nextNodeIds":[730590211]},{"nodeId":730590211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20577,"speakerName":"Aragaru","textMapHash":2600429098,"text":"\"Rejoice, let us:\"","nextNodeIds":[730590212]},{"nodeId":730590212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20577,"speakerName":"Aragaru","textMapHash":95261938,"text":"\"The pomegranate sings, the apples clap!\"","nextNodeIds":[730590213]},{"nodeId":730590213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Black Screen","textMapHash":9132666,"text":"The Aranara plant the dried flowers. With the ballad echoing in the wind, the flowers come back to life magically...","nextNodeIds":[730590214]},{"nodeId":730590214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":574646834,"text":"Wow... The three flowers are alive again!","nextNodeIds":[730590215]},{"nodeId":730590215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20578,"speakerName":"Aranaga","textMapHash":1338928146,"text":"Yes, because benevolent, Mawtiyima is. So, she gives memories a chance to resurrect.","nextNodeIds":[730590216]},{"nodeId":730590216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20576,"speakerName":"Aranakin","textMapHash":1882310586,"text":"Yeah! Even if we forget about you, the memories will... Hmm, be woven into the leaf veins and roots, turn into leaves, turn into tree rings!","nextNodeIds":[730590217]},{"nodeId":730590217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20577,"speakerName":"Aragaru","textMapHash":2033171554,"text":"Or turn into fatty worms, eaten by other worms. Other worms make things that nourish the plants, and make us grow!","nextNodeIds":[730590218]},{"nodeId":730590218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3405176554,"text":"But... You still can't recall anything about us, right?","nextNodeIds":[730590219]},{"nodeId":730590219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20578,"speakerName":"Aranaga","textMapHash":3938305514,"text":"Yes... Because, memories don't belong to you and me... The stories from the past, we have shared with all grass and trees in the forest...","nextNodeIds":[730590220]},{"nodeId":730590220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4273700730,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[730590221]},{"nodeId":730590221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20576,"speakerName":"Aranakin","textMapHash":2516003914,"text":"But it doesn't matter, because we are new friends now, right?","nextNodeIds":[730590222]},{"nodeId":730590222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","spea